  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_BYTES = DW/8;\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_WORDS = 1; // Assuming single word register for simplicity in this generic implementation\n\tlocalparam\tADDR_MASK = ~((1<<AW)-1);\n\n\treg\t[AW-1:0]\tADDR_REG;\n\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tDATA_REG;\n\treg\t\t\tSTATE; // IDLE, SETUP, ACCESS\n\treg\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE;\n\treg\t\t\tVALID;\n\treg\t\t\tSTRB_VALID;\n\treg\t\t[APBLSB:0]\tSTRB_MASK;\n\treg\t\t[DW-1:0]\tREAD_DATA;\n\treg\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT;\n\n\t// State Machine\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tADDR_REG <= {AW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\tDATA_REG <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tSTRB_VALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tSTRB_MASK <= {APBLSB{1'b0}};\n\t\t\tREAD_DATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\tcase (STATE)\n\t\t\t\tIDLE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= SETUP;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tADDR_REG <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWRITE_ENABLE <= PWRITE;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTRB_VALID <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTRB_MASK <= PWSTRB;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tREAD_DATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tSETUP: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= ACCESS;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tACCESS: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (WRITE_ENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Byte-strobed write\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (integer i = 0; i < NUM_BYTES; i = i + 1) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (STRB_MASK[i]) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDATA_REG[i*8 +: 8] <= PWDATA[i*8 +: 8];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Read\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tREAD_DATA <= DATA_REG;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tendcase\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Output assignments\n\tassign PREADY = (STATE == IDLE) || (STATE == SETUP) || (STATE == ACCESS);\n\tassign PRDATA = (STATE == ACCESS && !WRITE_ENABLE) ? READ_DATA : {DW{1'b0}};\n\tassign PSLVERR = PSLVERR_INT;\n\n\t// Simple error generation example: Invalid address or protocol violation\n\t// This is a placeholder for actual error logic based on PPROT or address decoding\n\talways @(*) begin\n\t\tPSLVERR_INT = 1'b0;\n\t\tif (STATE == ACCESS) begin\n\t\t\t// Example: If address is out of range (assuming only address 0 is valid for this simple model)\n\t\t\tif (ADDR_REG != 0) begin\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT = 1'b1;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t// Example: If PPROT is invalid (assuming 0 is valid, others are not)\n\t\t\tif (PPROT != 0) begin\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR_INT = 1'b1;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
